[26.235132, "o", "/app/baycue/forms.txt:8:flame.qprf\r\n/app/baycue/forms.txt:18:  tamp compiles /app/spanhearth/load.c; /app/spanhearth/wave.txt selects the generation.\r\n/app/baycue/BAYMAP.txt:2:cuewell    weigh status\r\n/app/baycue/BAYMAP.txt:3:wickdesk   flame emit\r\n/app/baycue/BAYMAP.txt:4:offpack    checksum helper and stamp notes\r\n/app/baycue/BAYMAP.txt:7:wickbin    layout.qmap and flame.qprf\r\n/app/baycue/shift.txt:1:Tamp rewrites span.elf in place and zeros the modification stamp so two tamps look like the same object on a listing. Scribe still returns 0 afterward. Weigh still exits 0.\r\n/app/offpack/sum.h:8:int file_sha256_hex(const char *path, char out[65]);\r\n"]
